## 4. Demand Assessment

{% if demand %}
### 4.1 Methodology

Demand estimation follows a bottom-up approach using sector-specific load benchmarks calibrated to Sub-Saharan African mini-grid deployments. Each customer segment is assigned a benchmark peak load (kW) and an hourly load shape profile. Diversity factors are applied based on customer count to reflect coincidence of peak demand.

